{% extends "base.html.twig" %}
{% block body %}
  <section class="my-5" aria-labelledby="about-title">
    <h1 id="about-title">About Questionnaire</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      Questionnaire is a small project for creating questionnaires, sharing
      them with participants, and collecting responses.
    </p>
    <p>
      Organize a questionnaire into steps, add questions and answer options,
      then publish it for people to browse and complete. Participants can work
      through the questions one step at a time.
    </p>
    <p>
      Whether you are gathering feedback, running a poll, or collecting
      information from a group, Questionnaire gives you one place to prepare
      your questions and review the responses.
    </p>
    <p>
      This project began as a learning exercise in 2020 and has recently been
      upgraded. It is a personal, non-professional project and is not intended
      as a production service.
    </p>
    <p>
      Created by Abdullah Alaswad.
      <a href="https://github.com/abdoun">Find me on GitHub</a>.
    </p>
    <a class="btn btn-primary mt-2" href="{{ path('questionnaires_browse') }}">
      Browse questionnaires
    </a>
  </section>
{% endblock %}